{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#card-zh","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 是面向 DSH Web 的网页主题插件，为工作区套用 DeepSeek 官网风格的浅色与深色视觉。它通过 Cordis bundle 挂载浏览器客户端，由客户端注入 CSS 和画布效果。主要功能包括 WebGL 流体渐变背景、随鼠标交互的点阵网格、新会话页粒子鱼标识、标题聚光灯，以及输入卡和气泡的磨砂玻璃样式。主题颜色会跟随页面的 color-scheme 更新，背景网格在静止时暂停绘制。适合希望美化 DSH Web 工作区的用户；需要支持 WebGL2、Canvas 2D 和 backdrop-filter 的现代浏览器，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-9","lib/client.js:154-180","lib/client.js:325-347","lib/client.js:377-386","lib/client.js:800-835"]}
{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#card-en","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-unknown-theme restyles DSH Web with a DeepSeek-inspired light or dark theme. It adds a WebGL fluid background, interactive grid, particle fish, cursor spotlight, and frosted composer cards. Colors follow the page theme. Requires WebGL2; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-9","lib/client.js:154-180","lib/client.js:325-347","lib/client.js:377-386","lib/client.js:800-835"]}
