{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#feature-1","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 的「流体渐变背景」功能：在 DSH Web 界面背后绘制动态 WebGL 流体色彩。页面加载后自动启动画布动画，按浅色或深色主题选取配色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:377-386","lib/client.js:457-463","lib/client.js:800-809"]}
{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#feature-2","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 的「交互点阵网格」功能：背景画布绘制点阵和网格线，指针靠近时网格发生位移、交叉点变亮变大。鼠标停止后动画循环会暂停，移动时再唤醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:469-480","lib/client.js:585-610"]}
{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#feature-3","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 的「粒子鱼标志」功能：新会话页显示由粒子构成的鱼形图案，指针可扰动粒子，粒子随后回到形状。插件观察页面 DOM，在新会话容器出现时挂载画布。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:619-640","lib/client.js:800-845"]}
{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#feature-4","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 的「标题聚光灯」功能：鼠标移动到新会话标题或鱼图标时显示反色圆环聚光灯，离开目标后隐藏。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:356-375"]}
{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#feature-5","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 的「磨砂玻璃组件」功能：为输入卡、用户气泡和会话控件应用半透明背景、模糊效果与细描边，悬停时部分控件加深底色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:190-218"]}
{"unit_id":"ycqaq233__dsh-unknown-theme#caveat-1","repo":"ycqaq233/dsh-unknown-theme","commit":"02e296a52b0ee53d1230bda14eed15683e547f1d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unknown-theme 使用 WebGL2 绘制流体背景；若浏览器无法创建 WebGL2 上下文，该背景不会启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:393-398","lib/client.js:457-463"]}
